                                                "sense_id": "04066061-7b60-38df-ab42-24b8b7813268",
                                                "text": "The propriety of the dissolution, too, was speedily seen in the improved state of the public peace: for twelve years we hear little of Orange riots, and nothing of such burnings and wreckings as those of Maghera, Maghery, and Annahagh."
                                            }
